 - 

v2->v3:
 - Add audio_refclk1 clock
 - Removed pinctrl_vdd_mmc2

v1->v2:
 - Fix AM62X_MCU_IOPAD macro
 - Fix OPP table comment
 - Remove reg_vdd_mmc2 regulator

